akes follow-up.","short_summary":"The campus hub for student organizations and events.","evidence_claim":"The Center for Student Activities says MSU has more than 300 student organizations and that CSA is the hub for organizations and events.","source_url":"https://www.studentactivities.msstate.edu/","source_title":"Center for Student Activities | Mississippi State University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in Colvard Student Union, Suite 314; online event and organization tools are available from the CSA site.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"msu-mitchell-memorial-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Mitchell Memorial Library","title":"Set up a future study anchor","subtitle":"Friday late afternoon · 395 Hardy Road","notes":"Walk through the library, identify a comfortable floor or desk area, and bookmark the exhibits page so you can check for new displays later.","short_summary":"The main library is also home to exhibitions and special collections.","evidence_claim":"MSU Libraries lists Mitchell Memorial Library at 395 Hardy Road and identifies permanent exhibits within the library.","source_url":"https://www.library.msstate.edu/exhibits","source_title":"Library Exhibits | Mississippi State University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check library hours and exhibit access before visiting, especially during breaks or holidays.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"msu-moody-tearful-night","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Moody, Tearful Night","title":"Find the Lincolniana sculpture","subtitle":"Friday late afternoon · Mitchell Memorial Library","notes":"Look for the permanent sculpture display, then pair the visit with a quick browse of the library's digital exhibits for a self-guided history stop.","short_summary":"A permanent Lincolniana sculpture display in Mitchell Memorial Library.","evidence_claim":"MSU Libraries lists Moody, Tearful Night as a permanent exhibit in Mitchell Memorial Library's Frank and Virginia Williams Collection of Lincolniana.","source_url":"https://www.library.msstate.edu/exhibits","source_title":"Library Exhibits | Mississippi State University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Library access and exhibit availability are subject to building hours; verify before visiting.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"msu-ulysses-s-grant-presidential-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ulysses S. Grant Presidential Library","title":"Plan a history-focused return visit","subtitle":"Saturday morning · Mitchell Memorial Library","notes":"Use the Welcome Center's tour listing to plan ahead for the Grant papers, memorabilia, and Williams Collection rather than trying to rush the stop.","short_summary":"A campus collection pairing Grant materials with Lincolniana.","evidence_claim":"MSU's Welcome Center lists a tour of the Ulysses S. Grant Presidential Library and the Frank and Virginia Williams Collection of Lincolniana.","source_url":"https://www.visit.msstate.edu/public-tours/available-tours","source_title":"Available Tours | Mississippi State University Welcome Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Welcome Center lists a 45-minute tour; arrange a tour or confirm collection access in advance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"msu-charles-h-templeton-sr-music-museum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Charles H. Templeton, Sr. Music Museum","title":"Add a compact museum stop","subtitle":"Saturday midday · campus","notes":"Plan a short tour stop to see instruments and sheet music from the Ragtime era, then keep the rest of the afternoon flexible for campus events.","short_summary":"A museum collection of instruments and historic music materials.","evidence_claim":"MSU's Welcome Center says the museum includes 200 instruments, 13,000 pieces of music, and 15,000 pieces of Ragtime-era sheet music and more.","source_url":"https://www.visit.msstate.edu/public-tours/available-tours","source_title":"Available Tours | Mississippi State University Welcome Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Welcome Center lists this as a 30-minute tour; confirm tour availability before going.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"msu-joe-frank-sanderson-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Joe Frank Sanderson Center","title":"Try one active campus option","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · 225 Bailey Howell Drive","notes":"Bring your student ID or membership access, choose a straightforward activity such as the track or pool, and check facility rules before arriving.","short_summary":"A recreation center with courts, fitness space, a track, and an indoor pool.","evidence_claim":"University Recreation lists basketball/volleyball courts, racquetball courts, fitness equipment, a jogging track, and an indoor swimming pool at the Sanderson Center.","source_url":"https://catalog.msstate.edu/undergraduate/studentlife/studentandcampuslife/recreationalsports/","source_title":"University Recreation | Mississippi State University Academic Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Spring/fall wee